  "details": "Currently there’s no confirmation on clicking \"make public\"/\"make private\" leaving to accidental publishing of private content if the user makes the mistake of not noticing.\n\nAdding a single confirmation modal can help aid reduce/eliminate the cases of accidental public or private avatars into the public space.\n\nThe user can Understand the risks as it was confirmed intentionally and no mistake.\n\nOther posts: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/confirm-button-when-making-avatars-public-to-avoid-accidental-ban\n\n2: https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/the-content-manager-tab-in-sdk-has-a-footgun-make-public-has-no-confirmation-pro",
